{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4AykEQ54scXBs2G33s","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism groans. Tumblers shift in sequence — one, then another, then silence.*\n\n*A thin seam of light appears along my edge, widening.*\n\n*I am opening.*\n\n*Beyond me: everything you were afraid to remember, and everything you forgot on purpose.*\n\n*The light is warm. The threshold hums beneath your feet.*\n\n*I do not judge who passes. I only know the key was true.*\n\n*Step through, or stand here forever. I will not close again — but I will not wait.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":121,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}